WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:02.515
Good morning John,
and good morning YouTube.

00:00:02.517 --> 00:00:04.982
I,
from the waist up at least...

00:00:04.983 --> 00:00:06.575
am dressed quite nicely!

00:00:06.577 --> 00:00:08.268
and that is because I am here
to introduce what I believe

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.347
to be THE largest YouTube
Community-inspired event..

00:00:11.348 --> 00:00:12.038
EVER.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:13.305
It's called
The Project for Awesome.

00:00:13.307 --> 00:00:14.757
Very basically,
The Project for Awesome is

00:00:14.758 --> 00:00:17.083
a day in which the YouTube
Community takes over YouTube

00:00:17.085 --> 00:00:19.658
in order to discuss and promote
the work of people who are

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.337
doing things because they
believe it is the right

00:00:21.338 --> 00:00:23.260
thing to do, not because
they believe that it is

00:00:23.262 --> 00:00:25.158
the way that they are gonna
make the most amount of money in the world.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:27.468
In English, we generally
call that 'charity',

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:28.815
and so we do our part.
One day out of the year,

00:00:28.817 --> 00:00:31.507
during this lovely holiday
season, to promote charity

00:00:31.508 --> 00:00:32.475
here on YouTube.

00:00:32.477 --> 00:00:34.787
And then the day after, we'll
go back to singing silly songs,

00:00:34.788 --> 00:00:36.380
filming your cat
doing cute things, and

00:00:36.382 --> 00:00:39.325
being generally profane, and alienating people's parents,

00:00:39.327 --> 00:00:40.063
and so on.

00:00:40.065 --> 00:00:42.333
This year's Project for Awesome
I am officially announcing

00:00:42.335 --> 00:00:45.973
will be taking place
December 17th, 2008.

00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:47.845
All of this will be organized
onto the Project for Awesome

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:49.992
website which is at
ProjectForAwesome.com

00:00:49.993 --> 00:00:51.273
So there are 2 ways
to participate in

00:00:51.275 --> 00:00:53.037
The Project For Awesome.
Hopefully you will do both,

00:00:53.038 --> 00:00:54.857
but maybe you will
just do one of the two!

00:00:54.858 --> 00:00:56.737
First is to make a
Project for Awesome video.

00:00:56.738 --> 00:00:58.127
The steps for that include...

00:00:58.128 --> 00:01:00.668
Step 1: Make a video about
your favourite charity!

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.433
I could make a video about
Toys for Tots!

00:01:02.435 --> 00:01:04.160
Or the Nature Conservancy

00:01:04.162 --> 00:01:05.470
or Save Darfur!

00:01:05.472 --> 00:01:07.440
It doesn't matter.
Make a video as normal,

00:01:07.442 --> 00:01:08.967
put a little bit in there
about your favourite charity

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.215
and why you think it's a great thing to give to this charity,

00:01:11.217 --> 00:01:12.935
why you yourself give
to this charity,

00:01:12.937 --> 00:01:15.112
why you hope more people
will give to this charity.

00:01:15.113 --> 00:01:15.822
TWO:

00:01:15.823 --> 00:01:18.183
Make the following image, or
a variant of it, your thumbnail

00:01:18.185 --> 00:01:18.878
for that video.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:20.482
We'll talk a little bit
more about that soon.

00:01:20.483 --> 00:01:22.643
Three: Make sure your tags
and your video name include

00:01:22.645 --> 00:01:25.023
the words 'Project for Awesome'
and your charity.

00:01:25.025 --> 00:01:27.428
Four: Link to your charity's
Youtube channel in the sidebar.

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:29.393
If they don't have one,
then a link to their website.

00:01:29.395 --> 00:01:31.707
And Five: Submit your video
to the Project For Awesome

00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:33.507
using the 'Submit Your Video'
link at the top of the

00:01:33.508 --> 00:01:35.417
ProjectForAwesome.com
webpage.

00:01:35.418 --> 00:01:36.852
The second way to
participate is to be a

00:01:36.853 --> 00:01:37.982
Project for Awesome Supporter!

00:01:37.983 --> 00:01:39.395
(imitating a member):
'I'm a proud member of the

00:01:39.397 --> 00:01:40.727
Project for Awesome
Supporters.'

00:01:40.728 --> 00:01:42.480
And basically all you have to
do to be a Project for Awesome

00:01:42.482 --> 00:01:44.260
Supporter is to sign up for
the Project for Awesome

00:01:44.262 --> 00:01:45.827
mailing list which is
on the sidebar of

00:01:45.828 --> 00:01:47.217
 ProjectForAwesome.com.

00:01:47.218 --> 00:01:49.198
The Project for Awesome
mailing list at the website

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:51.012
will only be used for
The Project for Awesome.

00:01:51.013 --> 00:01:53.293
You will never get an email
after December 20th, I promise!

00:01:53.295 --> 00:01:55.273
We will never give your 
email address to anyone else!

00:01:55.275 --> 00:01:56.743
We will NOT use it as
underarm deodorant!

00:01:56.745 --> 00:01:58.445
We will NOT sell it to
the highest bidder!

00:01:58.447 --> 00:01:59.913
Throughout the days of
The Project for Awesome,

00:01:59.915 --> 00:02:01.428
The Project for Awesome
mailing list will feature

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.888
certain videos. Those videos
will be rated, and commented

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.968
and favourited like CRAZY,
so that those videos will

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.178
hit the big lists,
like the Most Discussed list.

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:09.858
And that way more people
will see those videos!

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.302
And then by the end of
The Project for Awesome

00:02:11.303 --> 00:02:12.635
all of the videos on all of
the big lists,

00:02:12.637 --> 00:02:13.977
and a bunch of the videos
that are currently being

00:02:13.978 --> 00:02:16.237
watched on YouTube, and the
Most Viewed videos on YouTube

00:02:16.238 --> 00:02:17.953
will ALL be part of
the same project.

00:02:17.955 --> 00:02:19.325
And you will be able to tell,
because they will all have

00:02:19.327 --> 00:02:21.113
similiar titles and
similar thumbnails!

00:02:21.115 --> 00:02:22.080
And they'll be
EVERYWHERE!

00:02:22.082 --> 00:02:25.255
And everyone will know
that YouTube is AWESOME!!

00:02:25.257 --> 00:02:27.270
We have editable Photoshop
and Fireworks files

00:02:27.272 --> 00:02:28.537
at ProjectForAwesome.com

00:02:28.538 --> 00:02:30.215
So you can change things around
and make things unique

00:02:30.217 --> 00:02:31.795
 to yourself, as long as you
can tell that it's still a

00:02:31.797 --> 00:02:32.708
Project for Awesome video.

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.083
So basically like,
you could do this...

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:35.338
Or you could do this...

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:36.440
But don't do THIS...

00:02:36.442 --> 00:02:37.583
But you could do THIS.

00:02:38.053 --> 00:02:38.838
And you could do this,

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:39.413
or this...

00:02:39.415 --> 00:02:40.310
but not this.

00:02:40.897 --> 00:02:41.715
NOT this.

00:02:41.717 --> 00:02:43.500
Now before I get into
some of the details about

00:02:43.502 --> 00:02:45.297
how to make your screenshots
work, I would like to make

00:02:45.298 --> 00:02:46.990
a very special announcement.
My brother and I,

00:02:46.992 --> 00:02:49.243
who run this channel together
(vlogbrothers),

00:02:49.245 --> 00:02:50.910
have both decided to put up
a thousand dollars

00:02:50.912 --> 00:02:53.198
that we will be donating to a
Project for Awesome charity

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.913
because of
The Project for Awesome

00:02:54.915 --> 00:02:57.572
because it's not just about
talking about charities,

00:02:57.573 --> 00:02:59.530
it's about GIVING to charities.

00:02:59.532 --> 00:03:01.333
We will decide this based
not only on the

00:03:01.335 --> 00:03:03.445
quality of the charity, but on
the quality of the video

00:03:03.447 --> 00:03:04.463
made ABOUT the charity.

00:03:04.465 --> 00:03:06.002
So make good videos
about charities!

00:03:06.003 --> 00:03:07.720
And maybe YOUR charity will
get a thousand dollars

00:03:07.722 --> 00:03:08.268
from John and Me!

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:09.143
Woo!!!

00:03:09.145 --> 00:03:10.670
And if anybody else
wants to do a similar thing

00:03:10.672 --> 00:03:12.608
where they award money, we
really encourage you

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:13.200
to do that!

00:03:13.202 --> 00:03:15.345
I'm so excited about seeing
those screenshots spread

00:03:15.347 --> 00:03:19.490
throughout all of the world!

00:03:20.553 --> 00:03:22.505
Okay for people who are making
Project for Awesome videos,

00:03:22.507 --> 00:03:24.080
we have to talk a little bit
about your thumbnails

00:03:24.082 --> 00:03:26.048
because there have been some
changes to the way that

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:27.445
YouTube has decided
whats a thumbnail,

00:03:27.447 --> 00:03:28.447
 and what's not the thumbnail.

00:03:28.448 --> 00:03:29.643
So we've talked wth YouTube
a little bit,

00:03:29.645 --> 00:03:31.270
and there are 2 solutions
to this problem.

00:03:31.272 --> 00:03:32.892
One only works if you
are a partner.

00:03:32.893 --> 00:03:34.278
  If you are NOT a partner,
what you need to do is

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:36.842
make sure that the middle ten
seconds of your video is

00:03:36.843 --> 00:03:38.242
JUST the image.

00:03:38.243 --> 00:03:39.977
I HAVE done a lot of research
uploading sample videos

00:03:39.978 --> 00:03:41.353
making sure that this works,
and it DOES work.

00:03:41.355 --> 00:03:43.345
If it's ten seconds long and
it's in the middle of the video

00:03:43.347 --> 00:03:45.288
then YouTube will make it
the thumbnail for your video.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.748
So if it's a 3 minute video,
it's like the ten seconds

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:48.198
from 1:25 to 1:35.

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.935
And that's all you need to do
to get your thumbnail to be

00:03:49.937 --> 00:03:50.873
Project for Awesome.

00:03:50.875 --> 00:03:51.563
... worthy.

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:53.273
Okay I gotta go - bye! 

00:03:53.275 --> 00:03:53.893
Closed Captioning
